    "body": "A few things before this can go in.\n\nThis include path can escape the project root: `resolve_quoted_include` joins the name to the base directory but never checks the result stays inside the root. Please realpath it and compare against the real root.\n\nCould you add a short docstring for `resolve_quoted_include`?",
